      "result": {
        "reply_text": "The official portal to lodge complaints with the Uttar Pradesh Real Estate Regulatory Authority (UP RERA) against builders for project delay, possession, or agreement violations is the UP RERA eCourts module available at https://www.up-rera.in/.\n\nKeep your builder-buyer agreement, payment receipts, payment proofs, and all written communication with the builder ready.\n\nWhat I understood: Your builder in Uttar Pradesh is late by two years in providing possession of your property, and you want to know the official complaint portal for the property regulator.\n\nUnder UP RERA, allottees can lodge complaints electronically through the UP RERA eCourts module using Form M for complaints against promoters or agents regarding project delay, possession, or agreement violations, and track complaints at https://www.up-rera.in/.\n\nCould you please tell me the name of the builder and the project name?\n\nSource: Uttar Pradesh Real Estate Regulatory Authority - UP RERA eCourts, P UPRERA\n\nThis is legal information, not legal advice.",
